# Allowlist: only what the website and its /api functions need is uploaded
# to Vercel. Everything else in the repo (notes such as DESIGN.md or
# PENDIENTES-HOSTAWAY.md, agent/tooling config, local scripts, tests) stays
# in git but never becomes a public URL. A new top-level file or folder is
# private until it's added here on purpose.
/*
!/*.html
!/assets
!/villas
!/api
!/llms.txt
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/vercel.json
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
